{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2025-08", "window": 1, "start_date": 1754006400, "end_date": 1754611199, "month_true_total": 99, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 18:07:12 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "201602028", "author": {"steamid": "76561198078529153", "personaname": "Rycco", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198078529153/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 347, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 347, "last_played": 1754521018, "avatar": "2bb91aa26b3ce34152ac65ba241a7f29ac23a110"}, "language": "english", "review": "Capter 6 or so it keeps crashing", "timestamp_created": 1754522424, "timestamp_updated": 1754522424, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "201595208", "author": {"steamid": "76561197982656574", "personaname": "BMF9000", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197982656574/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 3176, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3176, "last_played": 1769805763, "avatar": "e09316fe23b85a9c06b78caec9547b763d361824"}, "language": "english", "review": "Well the game doesn't work anymore and after you have already owned it for so many years they make you pay for the new version . I hate this kind of tactic to squeeze all the money they can out of you instead of appreciating the folks whom are loyal fans, already paid for the game and love the franchise. Total bastards.\n\nUpdate: Install https://github.com/adrian-lebioda/SpaceMarineCoreFix/releases this .dll file into game directory, delete your spacemarine.exe file, run Steam file verification, then reboot. Finally it works again. I'm still leaving a negative review as this could have easily been rectified by a quick update.", "timestamp_created": 1754514028, "timestamp_updated": 1769806225, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 36, "votes_funny": 6, "weighted_vote_score": "0.65036928653717041", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "201591844", "author": {"steamid": "76561199085269478", "personaname": "Skuld the Norn", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199085269478/", "num_games_owned": 293, "num_reviews": 44, "playtime_forever": 558, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 558, "last_played": 1754506570, "avatar": "26b3d466ab6866de0d043eface9fa698130ab0cb"}, "language": "english", "review": "A charming game that allows you to dive into the world of epic and feel like a machine of unstoppable rage breaking through enemy hordes. For a few days you will be the Flame of Humanity lead by your inner Ultramarine voice who is screaming:\n[b]Blood for the Emperor, skulls for the Golden Throne![/b]\n...\n\nWell, now to other aspects. The game is nice, but rather easy, unhurried and clumsy. I mean, have you ever seen a space marine? While running he gets carried away by inertia and one need a completely unsuspicious oil tanker to hide behind. If you're seeking a core shooter, probably it's not it. If you want a portion of battle emotions, that's a different matter.\nAlso, I've no idea what is about online. Maybe it's dead, maybe not.", "timestamp_created": 1754510235, "timestamp_updated": 1754510319, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "